---
title: "deposit_collateral (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_key: verify obligation_key matches obligation.id
    q_validate_key --> q_error_auth: key mismatch
    q_validate_key --> q_check_pool: key valid
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert "unauthorized"
    q_check_pool --> q_error_pool: collateral_pool not found for coin_type
    q_check_pool --> q_deposit: collateral_pool exists
    q_error_pool --> [*]: revert "invalid collateral type"
    q_deposit --> q_update: obligation.collaterals[coin_type] += amount
    q_update --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_validate_key
        INV-001: Only ObligationKey holder can deposit into the Obligation
        INV-002: Collateral is stored inside the Obligation object (not in pool)
    end note

    note right of q_deposit
        INV-003: Deposited collateral cannot earn supply interest (collateral pools are separate from asset pools)
        INV-004: deposit amount > 0
    end note
